  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe avatar details page in the quick menu has the big menu and report buttons about half the size that they normally are in other menus.\n\n# Reproduction Steps:\n\n1. Open the quick menu.\n\n2. Open the “profile” wing.\n\n3. Select your avatar from the wing.\n\n4. See that the report and big menu buttons are tiny.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe report and big menu icons should be the same size as they are elsewhere in the quick menu.\n\n# Attachments Description:\n\nWhat the icons look like on the quick menu at the home page and profile pages, and what the icons look like on the quick menu on the avatar details page.",
